otes"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"Our servers also keep ordinary technical logs, such as IP address, browser type, and the pages requested, so the site can run and so we can limit abusive submissions."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"This marketing site does not use third-party advertising or analytics cookies. If you later use the Genie product, that service processes the operational data your company connects, including guest messages, tasks, and reservation records, under the instructions of your company."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"How we use it"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To reply to your demo request and talk about onboarding"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To understand the shape of your portfolio and the systems you already run"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To keep the website available and to block repeated or automated submissions"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To meet a legal obligation, if one applies"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"We do not sell personal information."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Where it is kept"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"Demo requests are stored in a private database used by this website. Access is limited to people who need it to respond to you. We keep a request for as long as we need it for that conversation, and then for a short period afterward in case you follow up. You can ask us to delete it sooner."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"We share personal information with service providers that host this website or help us operate it, and only so they can do that work. We also share it if the law requires it, or to protect 